# BRAVADO: the demo player again, raising harder (4, 6, 8, 10, 12 and 12
# packs) and banking at least 1,300 before the last fight: it walks out
# with 4,500 or more, every goal earned with real presses.
seed 2
game bravado
wait 10
cheat botplan 1
botuntil state >= 6 400000
cheat botplan 0
expect won == 1
expect cash >= 4500
expect goals == 7
expect save_best_cash >= 4500
